    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ace8279172c2bb95cd81f01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后，再来是“希望S”。\n在经典级要参加“皋月赏”、“日本德比”、\n“菊花赏”，还有“日本杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97caacdbd8d176d07cfbdf170cc7f259c125da9b3d648297d5531a4294b10e03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036100.json",
      "json_path": [
