      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b2479cf39030261bc259285",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠──由“皋月赏”、\n“日本德比”与“菊花赏”组成，\n都是赛马娘一生只能挑战一次的赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "334338798b07d17753138a2cf140bf51c16de106fe8898a5896f152d068442bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62a428bd85908f688a0bdb20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这三场赛事全胜的选手会被称为三冠赛马娘，\n所有人都会认同其实力无人能敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bf47dc2d1fe7d76667da9aa6f0caa23263c7302bb630888e652fa28d6122e7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
